OL,3,GNEWSAHut owner wins battle to keep
OL,4,Aliving in off-grid home he built
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn off-grid hut that produces its own
OL,7,Fheating and electricity can continue to
OL,8,Fbe the home of the man who built it, a
OL,9,Fcouncil has decided.
OL,11,FGeoffrey Finnimore, a self-employed
OL,12,Farchitectural designer, erected the
OL,13,Fstructure in Glandwr, near Crymych, in
OL,14,F2020, but never told authorities or
OL,15,Fasked for permission.
OL,17,FPembrokeshire council told him he must
OL,18,Fapply for retrospective permission for
OL,19,Fthe home that is self-sufficient, and
OL,20,Falso collects rain water.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
