OL,3,GNEWSAHut owner wins battle to keep
OL,4,Aliving in off-grid home he built
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the local authority found that
OL,7,Fbecause it has now been occupied as a
OL,8,Fhome for more than four years, it is
OL,9,Fimmune from prosecution action.
